# NAME: Muse-US
# DESCRIPTION: Meta Muse - US routing (complete, includes shared Meta/Facebook login infrastructure)
# UPDATED: 2026-11-01
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule; bind this rule set to a US-only policy group in Loon.
# NOTE: The Facebook family below also routes regular Facebook traffic via the US policy.
# NOTE: This affects device-to-Meta connections, not Muse Secure VM's server-side egress.

# Muse web, app, AI services, secure VM and shared-content endpoints
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,museai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecto1.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaiusercontent.com

# Meta login and account-related services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com

# Broader Meta / Facebook authentication and static resources
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
